WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
♪♪

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.335
Happy birthday, baby. 

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:03.920
What do you think of your new boat?

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:06.464
I'll tell you when I actually step foot on it.

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.924
♪♪

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.176
 Looks a little small.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.430
The past few months

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.348
have been a dark time.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.224
Molly

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.350
What are you doing in here?

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.268
♪♪

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.228
 Hailey? In our bedroom?

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:21.104
I can explain.

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.272
Was she even born when we

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.773
graduated college

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.526
Actually she was 1.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.235
Oooooh

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:27.902
Molly!

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:29.237
I want a divorce. 

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.074
You never think stuff like this

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.451
is gonna happen to you.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:35.618
But I'm much better now.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:42.292
Hello

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.126
Molly Novack?

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:45.128
I'm the executive director of your foundation

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:46.045
My what?

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:47.338
I was wondering if you wouldn't mind

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:48.715
coming into the office tomorrow.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.176
I have an office?

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:53.636
No.

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:55.555
Molly come in here girl.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:56.973
We're not used to meeting celebrities.

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:58.391
I'm not a celebrity.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.267
Yes you are.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:00.810
You're like the most famous cheated on

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:01.853
woman on the planet.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.521
Hi, there!

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:04.355
Let's be honest.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:06.357
You only showed up today because you got divorced.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:07.817
I never did the work

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.152
to find out who I am

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.321
It's really, really scary.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:14.866
I'm sorry I don't really care about any of that.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.284
Wow, when I said that to Oprah,

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:18.536
she gave me one of the biggest hugs.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:22.207
What do you think about Molly's foundation?

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.208
It's a bit more

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.876
complicated than organizing a

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:25.418
cocktail party

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:27.712
I need to prove I have substance.

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:30.298
♪♪

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:31.216
I am so excited to

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:32.300
save the world together

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:33.468
See you tomorrow

00:01:33.718 --> 00:01:34.803
and the next day

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:35.595
and the next day...

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.304
actually

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.680
Friday there's a thing in St. Bart's

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:38.389
I might wanna go to

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:39.974
but definitely next week.

00:01:42.852 --> 00:01:44.395
Surprise!

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:52.403
Look at us.

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:54.572
Two new Besties.

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:56.074
Part of me wants to hate you Molly,

00:01:56.699 --> 00:01:57.867
But you pull us together

00:01:57.867 --> 00:01:59.369
and you made us better.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:00.495
I think I'm gonna cry.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.083
You got so much money you could buy any man.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.252
Chris Hemsworth, Liam Hemsworth...

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:08.753
You could probably make you a whole new Hemsworth.

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:11.631
Oh my god. I need one of those.

